    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/7f3f4223f2ffe286450c11fef8c41213.poster.avif?t=1729625919\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/7f3f4223f2ffe286450c11fef8c41213.webm?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/7f3f4223f2ffe286450c11fef8c41213.mp4?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, you want to be a God?</h2>&quot;To Be A God&quot; is a challenging platformer with a unique recovery system which lets you save yourself from small mess-ups if you're quick enough!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/343ff42914d4364a522bd4451d2a99f4.poster.avif?t=1729625919\" width=364 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/343ff42914d4364a522bd4451d2a99f4.webm?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/343ff42914d4364a522bd4451d2a99f4.mp4?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Well, first you must pass some trials.</h2>To become a god, you must overcome many difficult challenges and puzzles put forth by a mysterious voice in this difficult and precise platformer.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/1dfd1be5cce375d217bf72d6ebad7764.poster.avif?t=1729625919\" width=444 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/1dfd1be5cce375d217bf72d6ebad7764.webm?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/1dfd1be5cce375d217bf72d6ebad7764.mp4?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The journey to godhood will be very difficult.</h2>Are you god enough?<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/fca23616623a517927c370fa8ae56d11.poster.avif?t=1729625919\" width=378 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/fca23616623a517927c370fa8ae56d11.webm?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/fca23616623a517927c370fa8ae56d11.mp4?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will fail.</h2>Remember, falling is fun!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/0a6378b8d683e5539902ce6fd94e3c86.poster.avif?t=1729625919\" width=296 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/0a6378b8d683e5539902ce6fd94e3c86.webm?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/0a6378b8d683e5539902ce6fd94e3c86.mp4?t=1729625919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Join Discord (link in right pane) for feedback and support!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938430/extras/7216780557a7c95